			CALCULATE(
			    SUM(L_Entries[Amount]),
			    L_Entries[G_L_Account_No] = "EMPCOUNT",
			
			    REMOVEFILTERS(DimCalendar),   -- ✅ remove date filter only
			
			    L_Entries[Posting_Date] <= MaxDate   -- ✅ apply cumulative logic
			)
			
			```
