	measure 'Rental Income' = ```
			
			
			 VAR DEBIT_ =
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM(L_Entries[Debit_Amount]),
			        VALUE(L_Entries[AccountNoNumeric]) = 37000 ,L_Entries[Source_Code] <> "CLSINCOME"
			    )
			VAR CREDIT_ =
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM(L_Entries[Credit_Amount]),
			        VALUE(L_Entries[AccountNoNumeric]) = 37000,L_Entries[Source_Code] <> "CLSINCOME"
			    )
			RETURN
			-1*(COALESCE(DEBIT_,0) - COALESCE(CREDIT_,0))
			```
